{{define "main"}}
<section class="policy-page">
    <article class="policy-page__content">
        <div class="draft-notice" role="alert">
            <p class="draft-notice__title">Draft — not approved for publication</p>
            <p class="draft-notice__description">This placeholder is not a formal vulnerability disclosure program. The scope and response commitments must be confirmed before publication.</p>
        </div>
        <h1 class="policy-page__title">Security Disclosure</h1>
        <p class="policy-page__introduction">Tabiri Analytics welcomes responsible reports about potential security issues affecting this website.</p>

        <div class="policy-sections">
            <section>
                <h2>Reporting a concern</h2>
                <p>Report a potential issue to <a href="mailto:savannah.kadima@tabirianalytics.com">savannah.kadima@tabirianalytics.com</a>, our monitored security reporting contact. Please do not include passwords, personal data, customer information, or other sensitive material in your initial report.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Responsible research</h2>
                <p><strong>For review:</strong> define authorized scope, testing limitations, prohibited actions, safe-harbor terms if offered, and any coordination or disclosure expectations. Do not assume authorization to test any system from this draft.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Response process</h2>
                <p><strong>For review:</strong> identify the team responsible for triage, acknowledgement targets, remediation coordination, and public disclosure decisions. Do not publish response-time commitments until operationally approved.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </article>
</section>
{{end}}
